---
import BaseLayout from '../components/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy policy" description="Draft privacy information for the Core & Pixel website." breadcrumbs={[{ label: 'Privacy' }]} noindex>
  <Breadcrumbs items={[{ label: 'Home', href: '/' }, { label: 'Privacy' }]} />
  <section class="page-hero"><p class="kicker">Privacy</p><h1>Privacy policy</h1><p>This draft must be replaced with a complete policy based on the services actually used on the production site.</p></section>
  <div class="content-narrow prose"><div class="draft-banner">Not a final privacy policy. Do not publish this page until the owner has checked it against the hosting provider, advertising, consent and data-processing setup.</div><h2>Owner and contact</h2><p>[Add the legal name or business name, postal details where required, and contact email.]</p><h2>Hosting and server logs</h2><p>[Describe the hosting provider, the access logs or statistics it collects, purposes, retention periods, recipients and applicable international transfers after checking the provider's documentation.]</p><h2>Cookies and similar technologies</h2><p>[Describe cookies and storage used by the production site, including any consent-management platform, advertising or analytics tools.]</p><h2>Your choices and rights</h2><p>[Add the rights and contact route that apply to the owner and the regions served. Have this wording reviewed for the actual operation.]</p><h2>Last updated</h2><p>[Add the date when the completed policy is approved.]</p></div>
</BaseLayout>
